stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CommandReceived
    CommandReceived --> CommandValidating : Inspect Payload & Target IDs

    CommandValidating --> RejectedInvalidCommand : Unknown ID / Unscheduled Target
    RejectedInvalidCommand --> AuditLogged : Prior ScheduleState Preserved

    CommandValidating --> SnapshotCreated : Clone Candidate State & Hash All Sessions (ALG-19)

    SnapshotCreated --> ClashAndCapacityPrecheck : Evaluate BR-01 / BR-04 / BR-09..BR-11
    ClashAndCapacityPrecheck --> RolledBackClash : Student Clash Detected (REJECTED_CLASH + 2 Courses)
    ClashAndCapacityPrecheck --> LocalSessionRecomputation : Prechecks Pass -> Identify Affected Sessions

    LocalSessionRecomputation --> RolledBackInfeasible : No Later Session / Capacity / Accessible Seat Exhausted
    LocalSessionRecomputation --> CrossSessionAudit : Local Halls, Seats & Delta Staff Recomputed

    CrossSessionAudit --> RolledBackAuditFailure : ALG-18 Global Hard Rule Failed
    CrossSessionAudit --> BlastRadiusHashCheck : ALG-18 Hard Rules Valid

    BlastRadiusHashCheck --> AbortedBugDetected : Unaffected Session Hash Mismatch
    BlastRadiusHashCheck --> CommittedNewVersion : All Unaffected Session Digests Identical

    RolledBackClash --> AuditLogged : Discard Candidate, Keep State v
    RolledBackInfeasible --> AuditLogged : Discard Candidate, Keep State v
    RolledBackAuditFailure --> AuditLogged : Discard Candidate, Keep State v
    CommittedNewVersion --> AuditLogged : Promote Candidate to State v+1 (APPLIED)

    AuditLogged --> [*]
